<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH RPIX CLOSES HIGHER LED BY KOMERCNI BANKA.</title>
<headline>CZECH RPIX CLOSES HIGHER LED BY KOMERCNI BANKA.</headline>
<text>
<p>1300 GMT - The Czech RPIX closes higher in relatively heavy</p>
<p>trading on Friday led by Komercni Banka.</p>
<p>* RPIX rises 4.9 points, 0.42 percent, to 1,182.1</p>
<p>* Turnover, 34 million crowns</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka gains 31 crowns to 2,490</p>
<p>* Chemopetrol rises three crowns to 1,290</p>
<p>* RIF falls five crowns to 995 - most heavily traded share</p>
<p>with turnover of 15.7 million crowns</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom rises 10 crowns to 3,395</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
